## PROTOCOL 3 — OTA vs APP STORE BUILD DECISION
Before publishing any update, check:

JS/TS only changes (app/, components/, data/, hooks/, lib/, constants/, assets/)?
→ OTA via: eas update --channel production --message "description"

Any changes to:
- app.json
- eas.json  
- package.json (dependencies)
- ios/
- android/
→ REQUIRES full App Store build: eas build --platform ios --profile production
→ Flag this to Joshua BEFORE proceeding.

