## PROTOCOL 4 — NATIVE CHANGE DETECTION
Before every eas update, run:
```bash
git diff --name-only HEAD | grep -E "^(ios/|android/|app\.json|eas\.json|package\.json)"
```
If any matches → block OTA, require App Store build, notify Joshua.

